/F2 18 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 772 Tm (Zeno Energy Agreement) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 753 Tm (SAMPLE DOCUMENT FOR THE PORTAL PROTOTYPE) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 739 Tm (Sample text for the portal prototype. This is not the legal agreement. It stands in for the) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 725 Tm (document a Battery as a Service \(BaaS\) customer signs in the Zeno app.) Tj
/F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 696 Tm (1. The service) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 682 Tm (Zeno provides charged batteries through its swap station network. The batteries remain Zeno's) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 668 Tm (property at all times; you pay for the energy you use.) Tj
/F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 639 Tm (2. Charges) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 625 Tm (Energy is charged per swap at the rate shown in the Zeno app at the time of the swap. Charges) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 611 Tm (are taken from your Zeno wallet, which must hold enough credit before a swap.) Tj
/F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 582 Tm (3. Care of batteries) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 568 Tm (Use batteries only in the vehicle they were issued for, do not open, puncture or charge them) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 554 Tm (outside a Zeno station, and report damage or loss within 24 hours.) Tj
/F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 525 Tm (4. Suspension) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 511 Tm (Zeno may suspend swaps if the wallet has insufficient credit, a battery is damaged by misuse,) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 497 Tm (or the vehicle is reported stolen. Swaps resume once the issue is resolved.) Tj
/F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 468 Tm (5. Ending the agreement) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 454 Tm (Either party may end this agreement with 30 days' notice. All batteries must be returned to a) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 440 Tm (Zeno hub, and any remaining wallet credit is refunded.) Tj
/F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 403 Tm (Signed by the customer) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 389 Tm (Signed electronically in the Zeno app. The signer's details and signature) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 375 Tm (record are held by Zeno and shown in the Zeno portal.) Tj
